#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Note: cdxgen resolves the whole build graph, so BomLens filters the SBOM "
"to the deployable set — compile and runtime scope — and drops the test and "
"provided toolchain (JUnit, Lombok, and the like) so the result reflects what "
"ships rather than the full build. To keep the complete resolved graph "
"instead, set `BOMLENS_MAVEN_FULL_GRAPH=1` ([Docker image environment "
"variables](docker-image.md#environment-variables)).\n"
msgstr ""

